### List wallets
GET http://localhost:5000/api/wallets?page=1&limit=10

### Search wallets
GET http://localhost:5000/api/wallets?q=Aarav

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/wallets/wallets-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner": "Diya Patel",
  "balance": 249,
  "currency": "INR"
}
